From 12af9fb27bb296fe68bb1c04fed445dbc19f1c2b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Okty <okty111-ux@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 14:30:24 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Fusion: colour TFT ST7789 320x240 with EC11 rotary encoder,
 display type selectable

- new colour page renderer (FusionTftPages) with the same 8 pages as the OLED
- ST7789 driver on the existing display header pins (software SPI), only
  changed 16x16 blocks are sent, in small portions so the radios keep running
- EC11 encoder on free GPIOs (interrupts): turn = next/previous page,
  push = like the BOOT button; optional backlight pin with brightness
- settings page: display type, colour inversion, BGR, pins

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EySGZ7zzCqzbQeGccwYzek
